---
description: Keep Keiros ERP UI copy plain and factual
alwaysApply: true
---

Do not write marketing, slogan, or “positioning” copy in the product UI.

Forbidden patterns include: “not a generic admin…”, “command center” as poetry, “indoor location intelligence” filler, “authenticated operators control…”, contrasting Keiros against other products, and long USP sentences.

Use short, literal labels and instructions only (Sign in, Reset password, Rooms, doors, units).
